,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软在Excel与Outlook中启用自研MAI模型以替代OpenAI和Anthropic</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX向FCC申请发射10万颗第三代卫星，构建AI时代全球通信底座</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta超级智能实验室发布Muse Image模型并接入Instagram与WhatsApp</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布统一音频大模型 Nemotron-Labs-Audex-30B-A3B</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ad388b8cf2ea4d52b0b880f7926cc7f3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达研究团队正式发布统一音频-文本大语言模型 Nemotron-Labs-Audex-30B-A3B（简称 Audex）。该模型基于纯文本 MoE 架构与单一 Transformer 解码器构建，通过将音频输入投影至文本嵌入空间，实现了音频与文本的深度融合。训练数据涵盖 1574 亿音频 token 与 3205 亿文本 token，并结合多阶段监督训练、Cascade RL 及多域在策略知识蒸馏技术。Audex 在音频理解、语音识别、翻译及生成任务中表现优异，且几乎未造成原版 LLM 在推理、对齐及长文本处理能力的衰退。作为一款开源模型，Audex 为开发者提供了可直接部署的成熟工具，解决了多模态模型在增强音频能力时常伴随的文本逻辑性能下降难题，为构建复杂音频交互智能体提供了新路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云开发加码微信AI小程序，免费送10亿Token额度并升级混元模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/79d3cc7b12e157a4f48f7bb507f1b506.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云开发宣布微信AI小程序成长计划大幅加码，向全行业开发者免费提供10亿Token大模型额度，并将AI生图免费额度从1万张提升至10万张。此次升级核心在于底层模型全面换代，小程序已全线接入腾讯最新一代混元Hy3大模型及Hy Image 3.0生图模型，显著提升文本理解与图像生成能力。资源包有效期为6个月，全行业开发者均可无门槛申请。针对新人开发者，腾讯提供6个月免费个人版云开发环境；老用户则可获得系统配置升级或120元代金券。此举旨在降低开发者在文娱、工具及社交等领域的研发与运营成本，通过算力与模型能力的双重扶持，助力开发者利用旗舰级AI能力实现产品迭代与创新。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软在Excel与Outlook中启用自研MAI模型以替代OpenAI和Anthropic</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2ab3ef4ec8c64bb0f52cf5c4949163e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软已正式在Excel和Outlook等核心Office产品中部署自研MAI系列模型，逐步替代此前依赖的OpenAI及Anthropic模型。目前，MAI模型每周处理数万条AI提示，标志着微软在构建自主可控、低成本AI基础设施方面取得实质进展。微软AI模型主管穆斯塔法·苏莱曼明确表示，此举旨在减少并最终消除对外部顶级AI实验室的依赖，以应对高昂的Token成本。在今年6月的Build开发者大会上，微软已发布7款新模型，其中部分模型在编码能力上已对标Anthropic的Opus 4.6。除Office套件外，MAI模型正加速渗透至GitHub Copilot及Teams视频会议转录等高频办公场景。这一战略转向表明，微软正从单纯的AI技术分销商向核心模型制造商转型，通过自研模型掌握AI技术自主权，从而优化Copil</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX向FCC申请发射10万颗第三代卫星，构建AI时代全球通信底座</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce74afa38ed5795a1b5d3ca55ae39f94.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX正式向美国联邦通信委员会（FCC）提交申请，计划发射并运营由10万颗卫星组成的第三代卫星星座，旨在打造承载全球互联网流量的底层基础设施。该星座规模较第二代扩大近10倍，将部署在323至477.5公里的两组轨道壳层中。除现有Ku、Ka、V和E频段外，SpaceX申请拓展92GHz至275GHz间的W频段和D频段，以满足AI驱动设备对海量回传能力的需求。此举意在构建“太空通信+地面AI”闭环生态，为旗下Grok大模型及收购的Cursor开发商Anysphere提供全球低延迟数据传输通道。SpaceX表示，该系统将成为AI时代的全球通信底座。目前，该计划的落地取决于FCC的审批进度，而SpaceX成熟的星舰发射能力为部署提供了工程可行性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta超级智能实验室发布Muse Image模型并接入Instagram与WhatsApp</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f697a92c5bb3a14fa7ca9bc12cbb8c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta超级智能实验室于7月7日正式推出首个图像生成模型Muse Image，该模型已集成至Meta AI应用，并同步登陆Instagram和WhatsApp平台。用户通过对话式提示即可生成高质量图像，支持文字渲染、背景擦除及二维码生成。Muse Image内置预设面板，支持将自拍转化为黏土动画或游戏角色，并能调用Facebook Marketplace商品进行室内设计预览。在技术层面，Muse Image配合Muse Spark完成布局规划与多视觉参考融合，支持圈画、草绘等交互式编辑。此外，该模型为Instagram Stories提供超30种AI特效，并计划在未来几周内向Advantage+ creative广告主开放。目前日常创作免费，超额需订阅付费方案。Meta同时确认，视频生成模型Muse Video</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
